    "%@\n\n" : {

    },
    "A moving selection snaps its edges and centre to the canvas and to other annotations, and a guide line shows what it snapped to. Hold ⌘ while dragging to place it freely. Arrow keys nudge by a point; a run of nudges undoes as one step. ⌥-drag leaves the original where it is and drags a copy." : {

    },
