    "Edit" : {

    },
    "Edit ▸ Align lines the selection up on a shared edge or centre; a single annotation aligns to the canvas. Distribute leaves equal gaps between three or more and keeps the outermost two in place. Bring Forward (⌘]) and Send Backward (⌘[) change which annotation is on top." : {

    },
