    "Recording studio" : {

    },
    "Redactions are burned into the exported pixels, not laid over them, so nobody can peel them off the file. A .kadr project keeps the original pixels so the redaction stays editable; share the flattened image, not the project." : {

    },
    "Redactions are burned into the saved image, which is the file to share. " : {

